WEBVTT

00:01:43.580 --> 00:01:45.580
Hey, pick up the pace!

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:48.210
You call yourself a man?

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:51.590
Even if you say that

00:01:52.090 --> 00:01:56.090
why is the first club activity of the Maken-Ki to run 50 laps around the schoolyard?

00:01:56.090 --> 00:02:00.260
Physical activity should be everyday business for the Maken-Ki.

00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:02.350
Basic physical strength is necessary.

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:03.970
Don't give up, Takeru-sama.

00:02:04.510 --> 00:02:09.230
That may be true, but this is not basic level anymore.

00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:13.400
Good, Takeru, Kengo.

00:02:13.730 --> 00:02:16.650
Hurry up or you'll get hit.

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:27.250
This may sound like a review of the school lesson,

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:33.250
but the so called Maken are special weapons each with their own Element.

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:36.630
The Maken we use are replicas...

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:46.510
I'm teaching you the basics of Maken and yet you're this rude.

00:02:46.510 --> 00:02:48.680
S-Sorry.

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:53.690
I won't accept you as part of the Kenkeibu with attitudes like that.

00:02:53.690 --> 00:02:58.190
Go run 50 laps around the schoolyard until you've completely awake.

00:02:58.190 --> 00:03:00.200
Eh? No way!

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:05.780
I beg you, Great President, please spare us.

00:03:05.780 --> 00:03:07.700
I-I don't care.

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:13.830
In that case, I have another way to clear your heads.

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:16.340
Here.

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:18.920
Nya, nya.

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:25.510
Today it's a cat.

00:03:25.510 --> 00:03:27.140
It's a cat.

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:32.270
Wh-What are you thinking?

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:36.980
But that seemed to wake those two up.

00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:45.030
A strong mind is stored within a strong body.

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:47.910
The opposite can be the same.

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:50.540
Especially since you boys think way too much about other things.

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:54.250
Focus your mind properly, abandon all other thoughts.

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:56.710
<i>I don't have that many other thoughts.</i>

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:58.550
<i>I think it's pretty normal.</i>

00:03:58.550 --> 00:04:02.260
<i>Concentrate, concentrate. I need to let Himagami-senpai see my good points.</i>

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:04.130
Everyone's admirable.

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:10.100
While meditating, it's important to accept what appears in your heart without resistance.

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:13.350
Understood?

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:15.850
<i>To accept the things that appear inside your heart</i>

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:17.440
<i>without resistance.</i>

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:36.460
You're not abandoning them at all.

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:40.460
I'm tired.

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:44.010
How did you end up like that?

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:47.590
In the past, this much work was nothing to you.

00:04:47.590 --> 00:04:50.100
You became like this <i>because</i> you slacked off.

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:53.520
No, I think I was the same before.

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:56.520
Inaho-chan is still so lively.

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:59.270
Yes, I'm very lively.

00:04:59.810 --> 00:05:01.570
Isn't there anything?

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:03.440
Maybe medicine for the pain?

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:05.070
Unfortunately not.

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:08.280
I'll buy some tomorrow so hold on till then.

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:11.790
Uh, I'm hurting everywhere.

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:15.580
In that case, let me massage you, Takeru-sama.

00:05:21.290 --> 00:05:23.510
How is this, Takeru-sama?

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:26.550
Yeah, very good.

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:28.890
How about this?

00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:31.720
Whoa, damn, this is too good.

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:35.350
Let me massage your back as well, Takeru-sama.

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:39.060
It's all right, you don't have to go that far.

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:42.360
Don't hold back.

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:44.070
Oh no.

00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:47.610
Takeru-sama, you're stiff.

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:48.820
Yes, there.

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:51.320
Stronger. Not there.

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:53.540
Here, right?

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:55.200
Yeah, I can feel it.

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:56.580
Wait.

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:59.170
Here, here.

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:01.500
And here.

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:05.000
Impressive, Haruko-senpai.

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:08.470
You know Takeru-sama's acupuncture points by heart.

00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:10.720
I-It's not like that.

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:13.680
I just did that a lot during training before.

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:15.680
There's no other way.

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:18.560
Now that it's come to this, let's finish it quickly.

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:19.100
OK.

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:23.360
What? You got a problem?

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:24.940
No, nothing.

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:29.630
You should be grateful to have two girls massaging you.

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:31.410
Y-Yes.

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:36.950
<i>As I thought, I can't feel any power from him right now.</i>

00:06:37.450 --> 00:06:41.460
<i>I have to verify the origin of his power.</i>

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:44.630
<i>Is he my enemy or not?</i>

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:48.920
You're really stiff.

00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:50.840
I-Is that so?

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:53.850
This is proof that you slacked off after you left the dojo.

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:59.680
How's it? My massage is effective, isn't it?

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:01.230
Ugh, it's too effective.

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:02.480
Himegami-san.

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:03.860
Ooyama Takeru.

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:07.360
Since tomorrow is the weekend, go out with me.

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:10.490
No objections, right?

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:13.360
N-No.

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:20.620
I wonder why she suddenly asked me out.

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:23.880
In the end she just wants me to carry her shopping bags.

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:26.630
And even though we're living together, she wants to meet outside.

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:31.420
It's hard to figure out what Himegami-san's thinking.

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:36.390
Rather than disliking me, it feels more like she hates me.

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:39.140
Are we really doing this?

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:41.390
I feel kinda bad.

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:44.440
Aren't you interested in their date?

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:45.440
Very much.

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:46.270
Right?

00:07:46.980 --> 00:07:47.770
There she is.

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:50.860
Sorry to make you wait.

00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:54.410
It's pretty nice weather today.

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:57.410
Very fitting for enjoying the fun of shopping.

00:07:57.410 --> 00:07:59.950
Kodama-senpai's very cute today.

00:07:59.950 --> 00:08:01.580
She's pretty serious.

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:04.830
Goth loli's are so great.

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:07.840
Be sure to be follow me.

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:11.340
What's wrong?

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:14.760
Those clothes really suit you.

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:16.680
Ha, ha, of course.

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:20.680
You'll still have to carry my bags even though you complimented me.

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:22.640
This is your punishment for peeking before.

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:23.810
I see.

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:29.520
This date... I'll pre— watch over it at all cost.

00:08:29.520 --> 00:08:31.440
Yes, Vice-President.

00:08:35.490 --> 00:08:36.950
Stalking start.

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:42.830
Oh, so Tenbi has a place like this, too?

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:44.330
Didn't you know?

00:08:44.330 --> 00:08:47.210
Tenbi has the status of a special district.

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:50.380
The prices, administration and even the laws are different from our country.

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:52.460
You could say it's a country within a country.

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:56.470
Huh? That is?

00:08:59.850 --> 00:09:03.220
The limited edition teddy announced to be released next week by the Kumaru Company,

00:09:03.220 --> 00:09:04.350
Hazuki-chan.

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:08.400
The fine design is just as the rumors said

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:11.940
and this exquisite workmanship that flawlessly brings out its cuteness.

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:13.740
There is no need to waver.

00:09:13.740 --> 00:09:14.360
Um...

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:15.700
Come with me, Takeru.

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:18.450
S-Sure.

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:22.540
Oh, this is new.

00:09:22.540 --> 00:09:24.660
Ah, you're well informed.

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:26.330
This just came in recently.

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:28.120
Then I'll take this.

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:32.670
This weaving and two layer frill aren't bad.

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:35.420
Such a bag is very rare, and...

00:09:36.420 --> 00:09:40.640
Thank you for coming here again. We hope to welcome you back soon.

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:43.810
Y-You're still gonna buy more?

00:09:46.140 --> 00:09:48.390
I can't see.

00:09:48.390 --> 00:09:50.230
Tired already?

00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:51.770
What a useless guy you are.

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:56.440
But I think you bought plenty already.

00:09:56.440 --> 00:10:00.410
Don't worry, the next shop will be the last one this morning.

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:07.750
What do we do, Vice-President?

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:11.210
The target is moving toward its tenth shop already.

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:12.750
Of course we're gonna watch over them.

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:14.960
What shop did they enter?

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:17.010
Um, that's...

00:10:22.510 --> 00:10:24.060
Um...

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:25.140
What's wrong?

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:27.430
Is this all right?

00:10:27.430 --> 00:10:28.810
What do you mean?

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:30.850
That I'm here.

00:10:30.850 --> 00:10:32.150
Don't worry about it.

00:10:32.150 --> 00:10:34.650
Even if you tell me not to worry...

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:37.990
Seeing you picking underwear, I'll start imagining things.

00:10:39.990 --> 00:10:41.910
Which do you think is better?

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:45.080
This one?

00:10:45.740 --> 00:10:47.580
Or this one?

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:50.000
Um... Ah...

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:52.290
Don't hold back. Just say it.

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:56.550
<i>This one?</i>

00:10:57.510 --> 00:10:58.970
<i>Or this one?</i>

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:02.840
<i>This one?</i>

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:05.100
<i>This one?</i>

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:07.060
Say, which one is it?

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:09.850
If you ask me that...

00:11:09.850 --> 00:11:11.850
Both are fine.

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:12.730
Takeru.

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:16.860
I'll go try them on.

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:21.200
Until I'm done you stand there and don't move.

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:22.360
Understood?

00:11:24.530 --> 00:11:27.370
If you peek, I'll kill you.

00:11:27.740 --> 00:11:29.870
U-Understood.

00:11:31.210 --> 00:11:34.750
Why would she want to go shopping with me?

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:35.790
There should be some new stuff.

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:37.210
Welcome.

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:53.560
Just my imagination.

00:11:55.980 --> 00:11:57.820
<i>Why?</i>

00:11:58.230 --> 00:12:03.820
<i>Why do I sense the same smell from him as that person... the same as Brother?</i>

00:12:03.820 --> 00:12:06.200
Wow, cute.

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:07.070
Awesome.

00:12:07.070 --> 00:12:08.450
There are so many.

00:12:08.450 --> 00:12:11.660
Ah, look there. So cute.

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:12.660
Where?

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:15.880
It's comfortable to use, but...

00:12:17.340 --> 00:12:19.170
Um, Himegami-san.

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:20.170
What's wrong?

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:22.670
Aren't you done yet?

00:12:22.670 --> 00:12:23.930
Just a little longer.

00:12:24.760 --> 00:12:26.800
My hand's getting numb.

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:29.010
Just a little while, OK? Put up with it.

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:31.020
This is nice.

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:33.020
This is good.

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:40.650
Be quiet! You're making me lose my concentration!

00:12:44.570 --> 00:12:46.280
Oh my gosh.

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:47.700
What's that?

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:48.780
No way.

00:12:50.030 --> 00:12:53.160
At this point, you can't talk about peeking anymore.

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:56.290
Anyway,

00:12:58.130 --> 00:12:59.500
Die once!

00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:03.090
Next is lunch.

00:13:03.590 --> 00:13:04.510
Yes.

00:13:06.510 --> 00:13:08.550
What happened?

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:10.930
Seems like he was punished.

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:12.770
That always happens, doesn't it?

00:13:13.270 --> 00:13:16.770
Seriously, bringing you here was a fundamental mistake.

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:19.060
S-Sorry.

00:13:27.030 --> 00:13:28.070
Maken-Ki!

00:13:32.450 --> 00:13:33.740
Maken-Ki!

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:40.210
Welcome back, Master and Mistress.

00:13:40.710 --> 00:13:42.170
Um... This is...

00:13:42.670 --> 00:13:45.210
A Maid Café, don't you know?

00:13:46.130 --> 00:13:47.680
I've heard of them.

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:49.640
Is Madogia free?

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:51.180
Yes, Mistress.

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:54.470
Good bye, Master.

00:13:54.470 --> 00:13:57.480
Um... Why did you ask me out today?

00:13:57.480 --> 00:14:00.020
Master, Mistress.

00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:04.650
Welcome back to Mansion Macaron.

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:10.530
Today, I, the maid Azukin, will clear up your fatigue from work with my delicious cooking!

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:15.040
Um, let me see.

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:19.040
I'll take the usual "Love Carbonara".

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:23.210
And a "Hand-Painted Love Omelet Rice" for this guy.

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:26.800
Wh-What is the meaning of this, Himegami?

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:28.970
Why did you bring him here?

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:34.760
Oh? Is it all right to talk to your master like that, Azukin?

00:14:36.220 --> 00:14:37.810
I understand.

00:14:38.180 --> 00:14:41.940
I'll bring you the food immediately!

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:45.610
Please enjoy yourselves.

00:14:52.780 --> 00:14:54.870
Azuki-san's impressive.

00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:56.450
And, she's cute.

00:14:56.450 --> 00:14:57.910
I'd like to try that on as well.

00:14:57.910 --> 00:14:59.040
Really?

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:05.040
There aren't that many customers in the shopping mall for some reason.

00:15:05.040 --> 00:15:08.510
That's because there aren't many people in Tenbi to being with.

00:15:08.510 --> 00:15:10.380
Also, look at that manager.

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:11.380
Manager?

00:15:11.970 --> 00:15:16.640
Oh, Azuki-chan. She made it like this again.

00:15:16.640 --> 00:15:20.640
She needs to be careful with work utensils.

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:25.110
I heard there are a lot of scared customers.

00:15:25.110 --> 00:15:26.020
I see.

00:15:26.770 --> 00:15:28.570
Sorry to have you wait.

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:29.400
Ah...

00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:31.030
What's wrong?

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:34.070
I don't really like green peas.

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:35.700
Master,

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:38.700
if you're too picky about food,

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:41.210
it'll turn like this.

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:43.750
Please eat it all up.

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:48.800
Please let me eat it.

00:15:52.090 --> 00:15:56.680
Master, Mistress, good bye.

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:08.860
How was it? That meal was pretty thrilling, huh?

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:10.900
My life has shortened.

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:14.070
But Azuki-senpai's getup...

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:15.950
Right?

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:20.790
I couldn't hold back a laugh the first time I saw it, either.

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:26.210
Yeah, in any case, it'd suit you more Himegami-san.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:31.880
It'd suit me more?

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:36.430
<i>What am I doing?</i>

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:42.060
<i>I took him out today to confirm the mark on his chest.</i>

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:45.350
<i>How could I have forgotten that and started having fun with him?</i>

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:48.060
<i>This really is my whole life's failure.</i>

00:16:48.060 --> 00:16:50.730
I wonder what they're talking about.

00:16:50.730 --> 00:16:53.360
They're probably deciding on which shop to visit next.

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:55.110
Are they going to shop more?

00:16:55.110 --> 00:16:57.570
I'm starting to pity him.

00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:01.580
Um, what's wrong?

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:06.040
I wonder if I said something to upset her again.

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:10.500
Girls are hard to figure out.

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:12.000
Ooyama Takeru.

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:21.640
<i>I'll show you how I'm gonna use my technique to uncover your true face.</i>

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:22.850
What's wrong?

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:25.640
I...

00:17:28.440 --> 00:17:29.900
What are you doing?

00:17:29.900 --> 00:17:35.860
L-Let me see your chest!

00:17:35.860 --> 00:17:38.410
My chest?

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:41.370
Hold on.

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:48.330
W-Who is it?

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:51.290
I'm Tanaka Biyou.

00:17:51.290 --> 00:17:53.670
I'm Kobayashi Ei.

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:55.670
I'm Yamada Shiisuke.

00:17:56.050 --> 00:17:58.680
We're the Himegami Kodama Fan Club.

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:02.560
What do you want?

00:18:02.560 --> 00:18:07.690
We are those who admire your beauty and have found together.

00:18:08.270 --> 00:18:11.560
To us Kodama-san is a goddess.

00:18:11.560 --> 00:18:16.190
We are prepared to sacrifice ourselves for the goddess anytime.

00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:20.410
We have to clean up the paths Kodama-san will walk.

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:23.910
Before Kodama-san goes into a shop, we'll definitely check it for her.

00:18:24.490 --> 00:18:26.540
We have also created a Kodama Movement Map.

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:30.670
so we can let new members predict your weekly tours.

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:33.170
Are you a bunch of idiots?

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:36.800
So we weren't the only ones following her.

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:39.760
Having a fan club is so awesome.

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:42.220
That's the rumored group of ardent fans?

00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:43.930
They're really taking it seriously.

00:18:43.930 --> 00:18:50.600
We adore you so much.  How can we allow you to be fooled by such a fishy person?

00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:54.020
That's right, even if we have to use force we'll prevent that.

00:18:54.020 --> 00:18:55.860
We'll keep that guy back!

00:18:56.530 --> 00:19:01.410
Is Tenbi's entrance exam this year a competition to measure the foolishness of idiots?

00:19:02.490 --> 00:19:05.160
Attack!

00:19:07.910 --> 00:19:10.710
Go cool your heads in there, idiots.

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:18.960
Is there still another idiot left?

00:19:20.550 --> 00:19:22.010
No, no.

00:19:22.010 --> 00:19:24.890
My goal is a little different.

00:19:25.300 --> 00:19:29.560
I'd like you to accept a Battle against me.

00:19:30.890 --> 00:19:35.480
Maken Blade Snake.

00:19:43.280 --> 00:19:45.070
I see.

00:19:45.070 --> 00:19:49.160
However, to attack without warning or performing a ritual first

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:51.410
is not what a warrior would do.

00:19:51.410 --> 00:19:53.250
You defiler.

00:19:55.670 --> 00:19:59.170
I'll show you my power, little girl.

00:19:59.170 --> 00:20:02.300
You're from Kamigari, aren't you?

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:06.260
You only got it half right.

00:20:06.260 --> 00:20:07.930
Half right?

00:20:07.930 --> 00:20:15.480
If I can bring back the combat data of a talented student from Tenbi, Kamigari will make use of me.

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:17.730
Kamigari?

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:20.730
What are the two of them talking about?

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:24.820
That's how it is, so let me finish you off.

00:20:31.160 --> 00:20:32.080
Takeru.

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:36.460
There's no mark.

00:20:42.590 --> 00:20:44.590
Himegami-san! I got you.

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:56.150
This happened because you underestimated me.

00:21:04.150 --> 00:21:05.650
What?

00:21:08.700 --> 00:21:10.370
Is that really Takeru?

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:12.290
He looks kinda cool.

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:14.870
Damn, why didn't I get blasted away?

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:17.880
This isn't the time to cuddle each other.

00:21:23.050 --> 00:21:24.470
What do you intend to do?

00:21:24.840 --> 00:21:27.300
Attacking a defenseless girl.

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:30.510
I'm asking what your intentions are!

00:21:32.890 --> 00:21:34.560
Is this your answer?

00:21:35.520 --> 00:21:40.980
The mark on his chest. I see, he has the same ability as Brother.

00:21:40.980 --> 00:21:45.900
I fear that this is the Convergence of the Soul, Blood Pointer.

00:21:59.290 --> 00:22:02.000
Oh. Wh-What did I do?

00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:04.170
Don't you remember?

00:22:04.170 --> 00:22:09.260
No, um, did I do something unnecessary again?

00:22:10.220 --> 00:22:14.220
No, you saved me.

00:22:14.220 --> 00:22:15.140
You have my gratitude.

00:22:15.720 --> 00:22:18.310
Here's a little appreciation.

00:22:22.480 --> 00:22:25.400
Kodama-san's purity!

00:22:25.400 --> 00:22:27.030
I'll kill you. I'll kill you.

00:22:27.030 --> 00:22:28.030
What?

00:22:28.030 --> 00:22:31.200
Haru-nee, Inaho-chan, Usui too.

00:22:31.200 --> 00:22:32.570
K-Kissing...

00:22:32.570 --> 00:22:35.830
That's too much. Something like a kiss is so sly.

00:22:35.830 --> 00:22:38.540
Why do the good things only happen to you?

00:22:38.540 --> 00:22:42.210
Give it to me. Give me an indirect kiss with Himegami-senpai.

00:22:42.210 --> 00:22:43.880
What are you saying?

00:22:44.590 --> 00:22:45.800
Stop it, you pervert.

00:22:45.800 --> 00:22:47.550
Help me, Haru-nee.

00:22:47.550 --> 00:22:49.420
I allow it.  Do it.

00:22:49.420 --> 00:22:51.470
Do it, do it.

00:22:51.470 --> 00:22:52.340
Stop it.

00:22:53.680 --> 00:22:55.350
Such...

00:24:29.020 --> 00:24:31.440
<i>I'm Himegami, the Teddy Bear Lover.</i>

00:24:31.440 --> 00:24:33.030
<i>Although we're called Maken users,</i>

00:24:33.030 --> 00:24:36.450
<i>having too many who aren't proficient at using it is a problem.</i>

00:24:36.450 --> 00:24:41.580
<i>Well, I don't have to worry about it, but you should practice properly.</i>
